quot;;" show="Value only" paramname="C" paramvalue="0.5n">C=0.5n</text></g><g x="390" y="215" transform="translate(390,215)" width="25" height="15" class="part" name="part" xo="0" yo="0" sref="X1" directory="std"><g width="150" top="572" left="0" height="150" zoom="20" symbol="{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;GND&quot;,&quot;reference&quot;:&quot;X&quot;,&quot;device&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;std&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;GND&quot;}}"></g><polyline points="9,12 21,12 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><polyline points="13,14 17,14 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><g points="15,5 15,10" class="polyline" name="pin" type="simple" netid="6" netidpos="0"><polyline points="15,5 15,10 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline><rect width="6" height="6" class="pin" x="12" y="2" style="stroke: rgb(0, 255, 0); fill: none; stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></rect><text r="0" x="13" y="12" transform="rotate(90 13 12)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;">p</text><text r="0" x="15" y="5" transform="rotate(0 15 5)" style="font-size: 12px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; display: none;"> </text><ellipse cx="15" cy="8.5" rx="1.5" ry="1.5" style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></ellipse><polygon points="13.5,10 16.5,10 15,11.5 " style="stroke: rgb(255, 0, 0); fill: rgb(255, 0, 0); stroke-width: 1px; display: none;"></polygon></g><polyline points="7,10 23,10 " class="polyline" name="polyline" style="stroke: #2196f3; fill: none; stroke-width: 1px;"></polyline></g><text class="draggable" name="text" x="30" y="18" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 30 18)" style="fill: rgb(255, 123, 0); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 14px; font-family: lighter;">Counter, D flip-flop and RC filter: bits and a bus in the wave viewer</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="118" y="106" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 118 106)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">clk</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="290" y="76" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 290 76)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">s[0:2] (bus, 3 lines)</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="286" y="186" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 286 186)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">nq0</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="300" y="156" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 300 156)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">q0</text><text class="draggable" name="text" x="412" y="176" r="0" rtemp="0" transform="rotate(0 412 176)" style="fill: rgb(100, 116, 139); font-weight: normal; font-style: italic; font-size: 9px; font-family: lighter;">lp</text><g transform="translate(30,260)" x="30" y="260" width="420" height="300" class="analysis" name="analysis" description="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;Time Domain&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;dcsweep&quot;:{&quot;param&quot;:&quot;Non&quot;,&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;start&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;time&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;0s&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;20us&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;20ns&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;ac&quot;:{&quot;start&quot;:&quot;1&quot;,&quot;stop&quot;:&quot;1000&quot;,&quot;step&quot;:&quot;100&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:&quot;dec&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;de&quot;,&quot;modified&quot;:false},&quot;yAxe&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;lp&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#d33636&quot;},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;clk&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#2f9e44&quot;,&quot;digital&quot;:{&quot;nodes&quot;:[&quot;clk&quot;],&quot;fmt&quot;:&quot;bit&quot;}},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;q0&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#2a73c0&quot;,&quot;digital&quot;:{&quot;nodes&quot;:[&quot;q0&quot;],&quot;fmt&quot;:&quot;bit&quot;}},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;count&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8a63d2&quot;,&quot;digital&quot;:{&quot;nodes&quot;:[&quot;s0&quot;,&quot;s1&quot;,&quot;s2&quot;],&quot;fmt&quot;:&quot;hex&quot;}},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;count (bin)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8a63d2&quot;,&quot;digital&quot;:{&quot;nodes&quot;:[&quot;s0&quot;,&quot;s1&quot;,&quot;s2&quot;],&quot;fmt&quot;:&quot;bin&quot;}},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;count (dec)&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#8a63d2&quot;,&quot;digital&quot;:{&quot;nodes&quot;:[&quot;s0&quot;,&quot;s1&quot;,&quot;s2&quot;],&quot;fmt&quot;:&quot;dec&quot;}}],&quot;xAxe&quot;:{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;None&quot;,&quot;unit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#000000&quot;,&quot;used&quot;:false},&quot;layout&quot;:{&quot;margin&quot;:{&quot;l&quot;:35,&quot;r&quot;:25,&quot;b&quot;:80,&quot;t&quot;:35},&quot;font&quot;:{&quot;color&quot;:&quot;#333333&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:11,&quot;family&quot;:&quot;Arial&quot;},&quot;paper_bgcolor&quot;:&quot;#ffffff&quot;,&quot;plot_bgcolor&quot;:&quot;#f8f8f8&quot;,&quot;bordercolor&quot;:&quot;#cccccc&quot;,&quot;yaxis&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;linear&quot;,&quot;gridcolor&quot;:&quot;#e0e0e0&quot;,&quot;showgrid&quot;:true},&quot;xaxis&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;linear&quot;,&quot;gridcolor&quot;:&quot;#e0e0e0&quot;,&quot;showgrid&quot;:true},&quot;showlegend&quot;:true,&quot;grid&quot;:{&quot;rows&quot;:1,&quot;columns&quot;:1,&quot;pattern&quot;:&quot;independent&quot;,&quot;roworder&quot;:&quot;bottom to top&quot;}},&quot;options&quot;:{&quot;adaptive&quot;:true,&quot;order&quot;:2,&quot;max_step&quot;:4e-8},&quot;sweep&quot;:{&quot;param&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;values&quot;:&quot;[]&quot;},&quot;wavevth&quot;:&quot;2.5&quot;}"><foreignObject x="0" y="0" width="420" height="300"><div name="plots" style="border-style: double; transform-origin: 0px 0px; transform: scale(0.6); box-sizing: border-box; border-width: 3px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; width: 700px; height: 500px;" ondblclick="showPlotInModel(this)"></div></foreignObject></g><g transform="translate(470,20)" x="470" y="20" title="codeHTML" width="560" height="419" class="codeHTML" name="codeHTML" rot="0"><foreignObject x="0" y="0" width="560" height="419" style="width: 560px; height: 419px;"><div name="htmlCode" style="zoom: 0.56; height: 748.214px; width: 1000px;" code="&lt;div class=&quot;ch&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Counter, D flip-flop and RC filter: bits and a bus in the wave viewer&lt;/h1&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ch-card&quot;&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Circuit Components&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clock (CK):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;DigitalClock&lt;/em&gt;, 1 MHz, duty 0.5, first rising edge at 0.5 &amp;micro;s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Counter (CN):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;Counter&lt;/em&gt;, 3 bits: counts the rising edges of &lt;em&gt;clk&lt;/em&gt;; its outputs are the bus &lt;em&gt;s[0:2]&lt;/em&gt; (bit 0 = LSB)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flip-flop (F0):&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;em&gt;DFF&lt;/em&gt; with D wired to its own inverted output &lt;em&gt;nq0&lt;/em&gt;: it toggles at every edge, so &lt;em&gt;q0&lt;/em&gt; is &lt;em&gt;clk&lt;/em&gt; divided by 2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Filter (RC, CP):&lt;/strong&gt; 2 k&amp;Omega; and 0.5 nF on &lt;em&gt;q0&lt;/em&gt;, output &lt;em&gt;lp&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Netlist&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-formula&quot;&gt;
CK = DigitalClock(&quot;clk&quot;)&lt;br&gt;
CN = Counter(&quot;clk&quot;, [&quot;s0&quot;, &quot;s1&quot;, &quot;s2&quot;])&lt;br&gt;
F0 = DFF(&quot;nq0&quot;, &quot;clk&quot;, &quot;q0&quot;, &quot;nq0&quot;)&lt;br&gt;
RC = Resistor(&quot;q0&quot;, &quot;lp&quot;) &amp;nbsp; CP = Capacitor(&quot;lp&quot;, &quot;0&quot;)
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;Digital outputs&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In the properties of the analysis, the rows &lt;em&gt;clk&lt;/em&gt;, &lt;em&gt;q0&lt;/em&gt; (one bit each) and &lt;em&gt;count&lt;/em&gt; (the three bits &lt;em&gt;s0 s1 s2&lt;/em&gt;) are digital outputs, added with &lt;em&gt;Add output&lt;/em&gt; in &lt;em&gt;Y axe outputs&lt;/em&gt;. A bit is drawn as a step trace; a bus is drawn as a hexagon holding its value, in hex, bin or dec (&lt;em&gt;Format&lt;/em&gt;). The threshold between 0 and 1 is 2.5 V (&lt;em&gt;Logic threshold&lt;/em&gt;). &lt;em&gt;lp&lt;/em&gt; stays an analog output, drawn below. The value inside a narrow hexagon appears after a zoom.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;ch-grid&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-col blue&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Results (0 &amp;hellip; 20 &amp;micro;s)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;count&lt;/em&gt; goes 0, 1, &amp;hellip; 7, 0 &amp;hellip; and changes at each rising edge (0.52 &amp;micro;s, 1.52 &amp;micro;s, &amp;hellip;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;q0&lt;/em&gt; toggles at each edge: period 2 &amp;micro;s&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;lp&lt;/em&gt; settles between 1.41 V and 3.59 V (RC = 1 &amp;micro;s, a triangle-like wave around 2.5 V)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;ch-col green&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Things to try&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Change &lt;em&gt;Format&lt;/em&gt; of &lt;em&gt;count&lt;/em&gt; to &lt;em&gt;bin&lt;/em&gt; or &lt;em&gt;dec&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the threshold to a band such as &lt;em&gt;1,4&lt;/em&gt;: a value inside it is drawn red (unknown)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the counter size by renaming the bus (for example &lt;em&gt;s[0:3]&lt;/em&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
"> 
    <!-- Parent container that responds to mouse movement -->
    <div class="chtool"> 
        
        <!-- tool bar-->
        <div class="ch-page-toolbar" style="zoom: 1.78571;">
            <button class="ch-toolbar-button" title="Home">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M12 3 L3 10 V21 H9 V15 H15 V21 H21 V10 Z"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
            <button class="ch-toolbar-button" title="Modified" onclick="modifyAction()">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                    <path d="M3 17.25V21h3.75L17.81 9.94l-3.75-3.75L3 17.25zM20.71 7.04c.39-.39.39-1.02 0-1.41l-2.34-2.34c-.39-.39-1.02-.39-1.41 0l-1.83 1.83 3.75 3.75 1.83-1.83z"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>

       <div class="ch">
<h1>Counter, D flip-flop and RC filter: bits and a bus in the wave viewer</h1>

<div class="ch-card">
<h2>Circuit Components</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Clock (CK):</strong> <em>DigitalClock</em>, 1 MHz, duty 0.5, first rising edge at 0.5 µs</li>
<li><strong>Counter (CN):</strong> <em>Counter</em>, 3 bits: counts the rising edges of <em>clk</em>; its outputs are the bus <em>s[0:2]</em> (bit 0 = LSB)</li>
<li><strong>Flip-flop (F0):</strong> <em>DFF</em> with D wired to its own inverted output <em>nq0</em>: it toggles at every edge, so <em>q0</em> is <em>clk</em> divided by 2</li>
<li><strong>Filter (RC, CP):</strong> 2 kΩ and 0.5 nF on <em>q0</em>, output <em>lp</em></li>
</ul>
</div>

<h2>Netlist</h2>
<div class="ch-formula">
CK = DigitalClock("clk")<br>
CN = Counter("clk", ["s0", "s1", "s2"])<br>
F0 = DFF("nq0", "clk", "q0", "nq0")<br>
RC = Resistor("q0", "lp") &nbsp; CP = Capacitor("lp", "0")
</div>

<h2>Digital outputs</h2>
<p>In the properties of the analysis, the rows <em>clk</em>, <em>q0</em> (one bit each) and <em>count</em> (the three bits <em>s0 s1 s2</em>) are digital outputs, added with <em>Add output</em> in <em>Y axe outputs</em>. A bit is drawn as a step trace; a bus is drawn as a hexagon holding its value, in hex, bin or dec (<em>Format</em>). The threshold between 0 and 1 is 2.5 V (<em>Logic threshold</em>). <em>lp</em> stays an analog output, drawn below. The value inside a narrow hexagon appears after a zoom.</p>

<div class="ch-grid">
<div class="ch-col blue">
<h3>Results (0 … 20 µs)</h3>
<ul>
<li><em>count</em> goes 0, 1, … 7, 0 … and changes at each rising edge (0.52 µs, 1.52 µs, …)</li>
<li><em>q0</em> toggles at each edge: period 2 µs</li>
<li><em>lp</em> settles between 1.41 V and 3.59 V (RC = 1 µs, a triangle-like wave around 2.5 V)</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="ch-col green">
<h3>Things to try</h3>
<ul>
<li>Change <em>Format</em> of <em>count</em> to <em>bin</em> or <em>dec</em></li>
<li>Set the threshold to a band such as <em>1,4</em>: a value inside it is drawn red (unknown)</li>
<li>Raise the counter size by renaming the bus (for example <em>s[0:3]</em>)</li>
</ul>
</div>
</div>
</div>

    </div>
    </div></foreignObject></g>